{"2993990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Am Machine", "steam_appid": 2993990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/1acc98ed990317b37275fc61a175219e.avif?t=1762437770\" width=1232 height=376 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In I Am Machine, an isometric rogue-lite adventure, play as Erik, a lone survivor in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by machines. With humanity on the brink of extinction, Erik must confront brutal mechanical foes as he embarks on a quest to save his kidnapped daughter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will determine his fate. Arm yourself with powerful weapons, enhance your abilities, and forge unlikely alliances as you battle deadly enemies across unforgiving environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/b38cd7f8cd0d93b0c85ff6ee54cbc728.poster.avif?t=1762437770\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/b38cd7f8cd0d93b0c85ff6ee54cbc728.webm?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/b38cd7f8cd0d93b0c85ff6ee54cbc728.mp4?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/62e2cbeca8eff762156ce502522e8d3e.avif?t=1762437770\" width=1171 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced, isometric combat where no two encounters are the same. Wield a mix of melee and ranged weapons, customizing Erik’s arsenal with over 100 boons to suit your style. Each biome presents unique challenges and mechanical threats, testing your resilience with new dangers and rewards at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/7d05d88a61aeb384b002bfd2078ee0bb.poster.avif?t=1762437770\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/7d05d88a61aeb384b002bfd2078ee0bb.webm?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/7d05d88a61aeb384b002bfd2078ee0bb.mp4?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/b0fe1528a1679c16cc42adbd3260e705.avif?t=1762437770\" width=1171 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect scrap from your fallen foes to craft wicked defenses — turrets, lasers, you name it. Strategically place your creations to permanently bolster your stronghold, helping you outlast the ruthless machines determined to scrap you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/fdf037de1274e39aee1ff81839aee948.poster.avif?t=1762437770\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993990/extras/fdf037de1274e39aee1ff81839aee948.webm?t=1762437770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/